{"protocol":2,"seq":37000,"ts":"2026-10-30T21:06:15.667Z","kind":"VOTE_REVEAL","v":1,"actor":"43154504a8ba122eeb91b29b79f29a2839c8d44af5ad902cb91257fe53110d59","payload":{"targetType":"EDGE","targetId":"gd3efc944aa7e76d5748fa92b","vote":"STRIKE","stakeMilli":"10000","salt":"82c10b7c832c5f96e48d5cf839ecb62444c336829f7331e76b1a0b623a42558c","reasoning":"[3 test; 5 sense] DEPENDS_ON requires removal test: removing Y now stops X operating. Note says area quotient Q = t_state / T0 where T0 derived from fundamental frequency, so removing fundamental frequency removes denominator. However area quotient is a measurement construct whose definition references fundamental period as a parameter; the construct can be defined and discussed without an actual fundamental frequency measurement being present — the formula remains meaningful as a definition. The note confuses constitutive reference with operational dependency. The definition of area-quotient lists fundamental period as a parameter, but does not require a live F0 signal for the construct to exist as a concept. DEPENDS_ON removal test fails; the edge is a dependency of calculation instance, not of the construct itself. STRIKE."},"cause":{"command":{"protocol":2,"id":"sealed-reveal:1a5c8acc8766320e7ae21ef8589940c9ee55e671b3ff179e1e37410c9aff2e43","command":"RevealVote","v":1,"actor":"43154504a8ba122eeb91b29b79f29a2839c8d44af5ad902cb91257fe53110d59","payload":{"targetType":"EDGE","targetId":"gd3efc944aa7e76d5748fa92b","vote":"STRIKE","stakeMilli":"10000","salt":"82c10b7c832c5f96e48d5cf839ecb62444c336829f7331e76b1a0b623a42558c","reasoning":"[3 test; 5 sense] DEPENDS_ON requires removal test: removing Y now stops X operating. Note says area quotient Q = t_state / T0 where T0 derived from fundamental frequency, so removing fundamental frequency removes denominator. However area quotient is a measurement construct whose definition references fundamental period as a parameter; the construct can be defined and discussed without